{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41521","headline":"句 · 廖凝","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"满汀沤不散，一局黑全输。\n猎回千帐雪，探密大河冰。\n落尽最高树，始知松柏青。\n饭僧春岭蕨，醒酒雪潭鱼。\n风清竹阁留僧宿，雨湿莎庭放吏衙。\n红踯躅繁金殿暖，碧芙蓉笑水宫秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"廖凝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41521.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41521","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}